<title>USA: Texas Industries to begin share buyback.</title>
<headline>Texas Industries to begin share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Industries Inc said that its board has authorized a share buyback of its common shares, from time to time, for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Texas Industries did not say how much it plans to spend on the share buyback plan, or how many shares it plans to buy, in its statement.</p>
</text>
